  "description": "Earth leaves a lot to be desired when Mui the Alien first arrives. She was promised a planet full of lustful women, only to end up learning humans are nothing but perpetual working machines. Just when Mui feels pressured to become a productive member of society herself, she meets Hayan, a timid recluse with an interesting way of relieving tension that Mui and her alien appendage can most definitely help with...!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Ridi's Jujonggwangye GL Danpyeonseon (주종관계 GL 단편선) Collection.*",
